# Dashboard (apps/dashboard)

- Next.js App Router, TypeScript `strict`, Tailwind CSS, Vitest for tests.
- Import contract types from `@cineforge/schemas`. Never hand-copy or redefine them.
  Regenerate with `make contracts` (never edit `packages/schemas/` by hand).
- Call the API same-origin (`/api/v1/*`, `/health`); Next rewrites proxy to
  `API_INTERNAL_URL` (`http://api:8000` in Docker, `http://localhost:8000` on host).
- Never use `window.alert()` or `window.confirm()`. Use `AppNoticeDialog` for results
  and `AppConfirmDialog` (variants `default`, `warning`, `danger`) for decisions.
- Workspace name `@cineforge/dashboard`; scripts `dev`, `build`, `start`, `test`,
  `lint`, `typecheck` must keep working (CI and Docker use them).
- `npm run dev` must bind all interfaces (Next default) so Docker can reach port 3000.
- No binary images in Git (SVG under `public/` is fine).
